          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-19520 lod: remove duplicate foreign mirror drop",
        "message": "LU-19520 lod: remove duplicate foreign mirror drop\n\nlod_qos_parse_config() skipped the foreign HSM and PCC mirrors of the\nlayout that a client set for a new file, and lod_verify_striping()\nlet a plain component with the foreign pattern through for it.\nlod_verify_striping() also drops these mirrors, removing them from\nthe layout buffer with lod_erase_comp_entry(), so every user of the\nlayout sees it without them.\n\nRemove lod_lum_is_foreign() and the code that used it.\n\nThis needs https://review.whamcloud.com/71423 (\"LU-19520 mdt: hide EC\nparity from clients that cannot parse it\") to land as well, so it can\nonly be tested once both have landed.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: If8c6158b5122545474c20508bc7f741bbe3ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
